vsm2.14:126.2:
Herein, it should be understood that when associated with the profitable consciousness described in the way beginning "(1)–(8) That
of the sense sphere is eight-fold, being classified according to joy, equanimity, knowledge, and prompting" (§83), it is profitable;
that associated with unprofitable consciousness is unprofitable; that associated with indeterminate consciousness is indeterminate.
